
  pipe (literal0 stall 1000 debug 0 )
   o: faninany |
      buffer |
      sort singleok |
      spec 1-* 4 |
      console ?

      literal {BHit Enter or any PF key |
      dup 4 |
   c: count lines |
      spec /0~~~ '/ 1 1-* n /' ~~~/ n |
      o: ?

      literal |
   k: count lines |
      dup |
      spec /~1~~ '/ 1 1-* n /' ~~~/ n |
      o: ?

      c: |
      spec /~~2~/ 1 1-* nw |
      o: ?

      k: |
      spec /~~~3/ 1 1-* nw |
      o: ?
      -- fini

